<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SAMPRAS BEATS DREEKMANN IN SWISS INDOOR FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS BEATS DREEKMANN IN SWISS INDOOR FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the Swiss indoor tennis championship on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding): 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 7-5 6-2 6-0</p>
</text>
